## Architecture Guidelines
1. **Ark UI Primitives**: UI primitives live in `src/components/ui/` with pure copy-paste ownership. Use `@ark-ui/solid/<component>`.
2. **Reactivity**: NEVER destructure props in SolidJS component functions. Use `splitProps(props, ["variant", "class", ...])`.
3. **Tailwind v4 & CVA**: Define component variants with `cva` and style data attributes (`data-[state=open]:...`). Use semantic tokens.
4. **Icons**: Use `lucide-solid`.
